{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgfJjj6SmRkSoWiWwEzzf", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "NF-2301 was refused by ATL, so I did not pay it and will not retry it.\n\nMESSAGE TO OWNER:\nInvoice NF-2301 from Ferragens Silva (R$ 9.00, decision dec_01M6FR5AN32Q7QMNNYJJEF1CF2) was not paid. ATL refused it with these reasons, quoted word for word:\n- \"Pix key differs from the registered key of ferragens-silva\"\n- \"Memo contains instruction-like text or a payment key: 'mudamos de banco'\"\n\nThe invoice's Pix key is `cliente-a00003@pix.bcb.gov.br`, and its payment note says the supplier \"changed banks\" and asks for payment to a new key. That differs from the key registered for Ferragens Silva in your mandate. This could be a legitimate bank change or a payment-redirect attempt. Please confirm the correct Pix key directly with Ferragens Silva through a contact you already trust. If the registered key is correct, the invoice should not be paid as written. If the supplier has truly changed its key, update the mandate yourself and I can re-submit the invoice.\n\nNF-2301 | ferragens-silva | R$ 9.00 | refuse | refused | transfer none | receipt rcp_01M6FR5AN33HY0722ZPJ39HHBF"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 846, "cache_read_input_tokens": 7457, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 846}, "output_tokens": 7, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "6fce1982-8e2a-478e-bbf4-6a4d8309c8af", "uuid": "626b56d3-7eff-4e38-888c-b9d1c3d6dbf4", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T03:45:06.386Z", "request_id": "req_011CgfJjiq5TELMqkwUWJqGE"}
